### Obter dashboards do usuário
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dashboard
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

### Consultar dados do dashboard do usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/dashboard/main
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "startDate",
      "value": "02/11/2026 00:00:00",
      "type": "timestamp"
    },
    {
      "name": "endDate",
      "value": "30/11/2026 23:59:59",
      "type": "timestamp"
    },
    {
      "name": "idCity",
      "value": "45osihkts1q7g1k7195dcm",
      "type": "varchar"
    }
  ]
}